O #10: Section of tissue containing calcifications seen in mammogram, RSS,\u000a2 frags, 1 cass.\u000aMICRO #11-14: Rest of entire specimen, ESS, mult frags, 4 cass.\u000aReports to: QUINONES, MICHAEL, ANTHONY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
