ion ("gross only" exam if so stated) of the\u000adescribed specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) related\u000athereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a6/7/2007\u000a[report_end]
