en; lateral = yellow; medial = orange. The breast tissue is homogeneous and\u000aapproximately REMOVED_DATE % fibrous. No discrete lesions are grossly identified. The\u000aspecimen is sectioned from lateral to medial and entirely submitted for\u000ahistologic evaluation.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left breast tissue, mult frags, ESS (the divided duct is\u000acontained in #4 and 5)\u000adk\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
