ver\u000ametallic clip. Sectioning reveals 75% tan-white firm fibrous tissue and 25%\u000aadipose tissue with no clip identified. The specimen blocks are radiographed,\u000ahowever, no clip is identified.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Anterior margin, perpendicular sections, 3 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Body, multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Posterior margin, perpendicular sections, 5 frags, ESS.\u000almc/pab\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Alessandra F Nascimento M.D., Electronically signed on\u000aWednesday February 24, 2010 at 03:43:00PM\u000a[report_end]
