ragments, RSS.\u000aCassette 6: Posterior perpendicular margin, two fragments, RSS.\u000aCassette REMOVED_DATE  Additional biopsy site,\u000atwo to three fragments per cassette, RSS.\u000adc\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE\u000a[report_end]
