asses are identified grossly. The specimen is entirely submitted\u000afrom lateral to medial.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral margin, perpendicular, 13 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections from lateral to medial, multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, 12 frags, ESS.\u000apsc\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
