xamination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Eric C Huang M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Thomas Brenn M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a12/4/2005\u000a[report_end]
