ite skin (0.8 cm\u000adiameter, REMOVED_DATE cm depth) containing a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm red/brown ill-defined\u000airregular macule which is REMOVED_DATE cm from the nearest side margin. The specimen is\u000ainked at the base, sectioned and entirely submitted.\u000aMicro 3: 3 frags, ESS.\u000akks\u000aReports to: MILLER, DANIELLE, M., PHD\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN- OTHER THAN CYST, TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN- OTHER THAN CYST, TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN- OTHER THAN CYST, TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT\u000a[report_end]
