cro 6, skin, 1 fragment, RSS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  fibrous area, 2 fragments, RSS.\u000aReports to: ERIKSSON, ELOF M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE\u000a[report_end]
