sy cavity\u000ais located REMOVED_DATE cm from the inferior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the superior margin,\u000a0.4 cm from the anterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from the posterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000amedial margin, and REMOVED_DATE cm from the lateral margin. The remainder of the\u000abreast is composed primarily of adipose tissue. The specimen is entirely\u000asubmitted from lateral to medial.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left breast re-excisional tissue, mult frags, ESS\u000arp\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
