est margin to\u000athe core biopsy site is REMOVED_DATE cm. The lumpectomy is approximately 90% adipose\u000atissue. The remainder is composed of strands of fibrous tissue which are\u000aunremarkable. The specimen is entirely submitted.\u000aMicro #1+2: Breast tips, 2 frags, ESS\u000aMicro #3+4: Biopsy cavity, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro #5-9: Remainder of specimen, 6 frags, ESS.\u000ajeb/\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
