dipose tissue in the\u000aspecimen. No areas grossly suspicious for carcinoma. The entire specimen\u000aincluding the inked surgical margins is submitted for histology.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast biopsy, 1 to 2 frags per cassette, ESS (tissue\u000asubmitted serially from medial to lateral margins.\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
