ic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on Monday\u000aREMOVED_MONTH 24, 2008 at 04:26:47PM\u000a[report_end]
