fications.\u000aMICRO #1-12: Serial cross sections of specimen perpendicular to margins, mult\u000afrags, ESS, 12 cass.\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
