y cavity, RSS, mult frags,\u000a3 cass.\u000aPart two, "axillary contents", consists of a single fragment of fibrofatty\u000atissue (8.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm). Approximately seven lymph nodes are grossly\u000aidentified.\u000aMICRO #13-15: Axillary lymph nodes, RSs, mult frags, 3 cass.\u000aReports to: EBERLEIN, TIMOTHY, JOSEPH M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: LUMPECTOMY\u000a[report_end]
