VAccession Number: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID Report Status: Final\u000aType: Surgical Pathology\u000aSpecimen Type: Breast core needle biopsy\u000aProcedure Date: REMOVED_DATE \u000aOrdering Provider: DIANNE GEORGIAN-SMITH M.D.\u000aCASE: BS-09-REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID\u000aPATIENT: REMOVED_PATIENT_NAME\u000aResident: Mariana A. Stoleru, M.D.\u000aPathologist: Jane E. Brock, M.B., B.S., Ph.D.\u000aPATHOLOGIC DIAGNOSIS:\u000aRIGHT BREAST, UPPER INNER QUADRANT, 14G ULTRASOUND GUIDED CORE NEEDLE BIOPSIES\u000aFOR AN ILL-DEFINED REMOVED_DATE CM MASS:\u000aFocal fibroadenomatoid change with sclerotic stroma, small cysts and epithelial\u000ahyperplasia (see Note).\u000aNote: The findings may represent the lesion of interest, however radiologic\u000acorrelation is advised to ensure the biopsy is representative of the radiologic\u000alesion.\u000aCLINICAL DATA:\u000aHISTORY: 50 year old with newly diagnosed DCIS/ADH left. Now with MR "mass" and\u000apossible sono correlate. DH DX: FCC r/o ca\u000aBREAST IMAGING FINDING:\u000a1. Right: 1 cm and ill-defined mass.\u000aLOCATION:\u000a1. Right: upper inner\u000aTYPE OF CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY:\u000a1. 14G Ultrasound\u000aTISSUE SUBMITTED:\u000a1. 14G Ultrasound - Pink\u000aGROSS DESCRIPTION:\u000aThe specimen is received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name, unit\u000anumber, and "right breast into formalin REMOVED_DATE  10:30 am", consists of multiple\u000ayellow/white focally hemorrhagic fibrofatty tissues (aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x\u000a0.2 cm), which are received in a pink cassette. The specimens are submitted in\u000atoto.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Multi frags, ESS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID\u000aCP/ag\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jane E. Brock M.B., B.S., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000aThursday REMOVED_MONTH 08, 2009 at 03:30:40PM\u000a[report_end]
