y.\u000adfi\u000aReports to: PRIBAZ, JULIAN, JOSEPH M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST IMPLANT\u000a[report_end]
