E x REMOVED_DATE ) which is; REMOVED_DATE cm to superior, REMOVED_DATE cm to inferior, REMOVED_DATE \u000acm to anterior, REMOVED_DATE cm to posterior, REMOVED_DATE cm from the medial and REMOVED_DATE cm from the\u000alateral resection margin. A clip is identified at the anterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm\u000afrom the nodule. The specimen is entirely submitted for histology.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Medial margin, perpendicular, 3 frags each, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Lateral margin, perpendicular, 5 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Remainder of specimen (clip in REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID), 1 frag each, ESS.\u000aAL/mmm\u000aCASE NUMBER: BS-07-REMOVED_CASE_ID\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jason L Hornick M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a8/28/2007\u000a[report_end]
