k, and the old\u000amargin is inked blue.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Larger fragment, multiple frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Smaller fragment, multiple frags, ESS.\u000aPart B, sub labeled "Right posterior shave margin with stitched new margin",\u000aconsists of a single fragment of fibroadipose tissue (5.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm),\u000awhich has a single, whip stitch indicating the new margins. The new margin is\u000ainked black, and the old margin is inked blue.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Entire specimen, multiple frags, ESS.\u000ajoc/MMM\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Joseph Woodward Carlson M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aResident Review by Joseph Woodward Carlson M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aResident Review by Joseph Woodward Carlson M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Review by Vania Nose MD, PhD, on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Vania Nose MD, PhD, Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
