is composed entirely of\u000aunremarkable pink/tan breast parenchyma on cut section.\u000aMicros #10-14: ESS, 7 frags, 5 cass\u000aPart three, labelled "#1. nevi left back", consists of a tan skin ellipse, REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE cm with two crusty dark brown confluent macular papules, REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000aoverall dimension. The surface of the specimen is papillary and raised\u000aapproximately REMOVED_DATE cm above the skin surface.\u000aMicro #15: Tips, 2 frags, 1 cass.\u000aMicro #16: ESS, 6 frags, 1 cass.\u000aReports to: KNOX, JAMES, B. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SKIN- OTHER THAN CYST, TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT\u000a[report_end]
