ED_DATE  representative sections of adjacent fibrous tissue, 1 frag each,\u000aRSS.\u000aMicro 8: representative sections of superior and medial border, 1 frag,\u000aRSS.\u000aMicro 9: representative section of the lateral inferior border, 1 frag, RSS.\u000ako\u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
