VAccession Number: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID Report Status: Final\u000aType: Surgical Pathology\u000aPathology Report REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aAccessioned On: REMOVED_DATE \u000aNUCCI, MARISA, ROSE, M.D.\u000aDIAGNOSIS: by NUCCI,MARISA ROSE,M.D.\u000a1) RIGHT BREAST, RETROAREOLAR EXCISIONAL BIOPSY:\u000aFocally severely atypical duct hyperplasia.\u000aAdjacent atypical papilloma extending to within REMOVED_DATE cm of posterior (black\u000ainked) margin.\u000a(Levels examined).\u000aNOTE: Re-excision is recommended. Select slides from this case were\u000areviewed with Dr. S. Schnitt, who concurs.\u000a2) SPECIMEN LABELED "RIGHT BREAST, TISSUE BEHIND NIPPLE":\u000aBenign breast tissue.\u000aCLINICAL DATA:\u000aHistory: A 65 year old post menopausal female with spontaneous bloody\u000aright nipple discharge, (-) mammogram & U/S, ductogram\u000aunsuccessful.\u000aOperation: R breast retroareolar duct excision.\u000aClinical Diagnosis: R nipple discharge.\u000aTISSUE SUBMITTED: 1. R breast tissue - short superior, long lateral, whip\u000astitch deep, blue tie on denuded duct.\u000a2. R breast tissue behind nipple.\u000aGROSS DESCRIPTION: by CHANG,BRIAN S.,M.D.,PH.D.\u000aThe specimen is received fixed in two parts, labeled with the patient's name\u000aand unit number.\u000aSpecimen #1, "right breast areolar duct", consists of a REMOVED_DATE x 3 x REMOVED_DATE cm breast\u000aspecimen with three orienting sutures indicating lateral, superior and deep\u000amargins. A blue suture indicates the duct. The specimen is inked per\u000apathology protocol for the evaluation of margins: posterior = black; anterior\u000a= blue; superior = red; inferior = green; lateral = yellow; medial = orange.\u000aSerial sectioning reveals a dark tan parenchyma with light tan mucin.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast mass entirely sectioned serially from lateral to medial, 11\u000afrag, ESS.\u000aSpecimen #2, "right breast tissue behind nipple", consists of a single fragment\u000aof white soft tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aMicro 9: breast tissue, 1 frag, ESS.\u000absc\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
