ro 2: inferior margin, 3 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of the specimen, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE contain the area of calcification.\u000arfi\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
