", in a pink cassette, and consists of multiple,\u000asoft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (2.2 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000aaggregate).\u000aMicro 1: Multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart two, labeled "Right breast", in a green cassette, and consists of\u000amultiple, soft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (1.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in\u000aaggregate).\u000aMicro 2: Multi frags, ESS.\u000adf\u000aReports to: BABAGBEMI, TOKUNBO M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
