 of two (2) blue cassettes. One cassette is labeled "A"\u000aand contains multiple soft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (1 x REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE cm). The other cassette is labeled "B" and contains similar tissue\u000afragments (2.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm).\u000aMicro 3: multi frag, A blue cassette with calcifications,ESS\u000aMicro 4: multi frag, B blue cassette without calcifcations, ESS\u000atr\u000aReports to: ASHLEY, STANLEY, W. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES)\u000a[report_end]
