_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm nodule, likely consistent with\u000aintraparenchymal lymph node, which is marked by a surgical clip, in the area of\u000athe localizing wire. The specimen is received along with an accompanying\u000aradiograph demonstrating the localizing wire and clip in place within the\u000aspecimen, along with incidental calcifications in this area.\u000aThe presumed lymph node is REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest anterior margin, REMOVED_DATE cm from\u000athe closest medial margin, at least REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest inferior margin,\u000aand REMOVED_DATE cm from the closest posterior margin. The distance to the nearest true\u000alateral margin cannot be determined, due to the previously mentioned defect.\u000aThe closest inked lateral surface is within REMOVED_DATE cm. The entire specimen is\u000asubmitted sequentially from inferomedial to superolateral, with area of\u000ainterest in micro-cassettes REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID, and tissue with surgical clip in micro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Entire specimen, sequentially submitted, multi frags, ESS.\u000aNOTE: REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDinferior, medial; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDposterior, inferior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial, inferior,\u000aposterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial, anterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial, inferior, anterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial,\u000aposterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial, anterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDmedial, anterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDposterior, superior,\u000aanterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDposterior, medial; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior, posterior; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior,\u000aposterior, lateral; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior, posterior, lateral; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior, anterior;\u000aREMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior, anterior, lateral; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDlateral; REMOVED_ACCESSION_IDsuperior, anterior, lateral.\u000aDB/mmm\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Massimo F Loda M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
