 containing multiple cylindrical focally hemorrhagic\u000afibrofatty soft tissues (1.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate). The specimen is\u000asubmitted in toto.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Contents of brown cassette labeled "A", multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Contents of brown cassette labeled "B", multi frags, ESS.\u000aPart B, labeled "right breast green", consists of two green cassettes, one\u000agreen cassette labeled "A", containing multiple cylindrical focally hemorrhagic\u000afibrofatty soft tissues (2.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate), and the other green\u000acassette labeled "B", containing multiple cylindrical fibrofatty soft tissues\u000a(1.3 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate). The specimen is submitted in toto.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Contents of green cassette labeled "A", multi frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Contents of green cassette labeled "B", multi frags, ESS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID\u000ajc/lp\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jane E. Brock M.B., B.S., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000aWednesday REMOVED_MONTH 10, 2009 at 01:29:57PM\u000a[report_end]
