n jar.\u000aThe specimen radiograph is reviewed and reveals a clip and a localizing wire.\u000aMicro 1 : area of clip, 3 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of specimen, 2 frags per cassette, ESS.\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
