ecimen is entirely\u000asubmitted from inferior to superior.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  inferior margin, perpendicular, 10 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections from inferior to superior, 7 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  superior margin, perpendicular, 9 frags, ESS\u000apsc\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
