VAccession Number: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID Report Status: Final\u000aType: Surgical Pathology\u000aPathology Report REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000aAccessioned On: REMOVED_DATE \u000aGRANTER, SCOTT, R., M.D.\u000aDIAGNOSIS: by GRANTER,SCOTT R.,M.D.\u000aLEFT BREAST, WIRE LOCALIZED BIOPSY FOR CALCIFICATIONS:\u000aEXTENSIVE LOBULAR CARCINOMA IN SITU, is present in 12 of 14 blocks.\u000aAtypical ductal hyperplasia is present within a complex sclerosing lesion\u000a(block 3; levels examined) and in additional breast tissue (block\u000a10;levels examined).\u000aCalcifications are present associated with the complex sclerosing lesion.\u000aApocrine cysts are present.\u000aCLINICAL DATA:\u000aHistory: Left abnormal mammogram/left breast mass\u000aOperation: Left breast biopsy, with needle localization\u000aClinical Diagnosis: Left breast mass/left abnormal mammogram\u000aTISSUE SUBMITTED: Left breast mass (short/superior; long/lateral)\u000aRADIOLOGY REPORT: Calcifications in specimen. Dr. Denison/kp\u000aGROSS DESCRIPTION: by DORER,RUSSELL K.,M.D.,PH.D.\u000aThe specimen is received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number,\u000aand "left breast mass (short/superior; long/lateral)", and consists of a\u000afragment of yellow/pink fibroadipose tissue (4.2 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm), which is\u000aoriented with two sutures (short designated superior, long designated lateral).\u000aThe specimen is inked per pathology protocol for the evaluation of margins:\u000aposterior = black; anterior = blue; superior = red; inferior = green; lateral\u000a= yellow; medial = orange. The specimen consists of approximately 80%\u000aunremarkable yellow adipose tissue and 20% white fibrous tissue. No areas\u000agrossly suspicious for invasive cracinoma are present. The specimen is\u000aentirely submitted.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Breast biopsy, submitted from lateral to medial margins, multi\u000afrags, ESS\u000ardo\u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
