0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm), with the\u000aremainder of the specimen consisting of intermixed thin strands of fibrous\u000atissue and yellow lobulated adipose tissue, predominantly in the superoinferior\u000aaspect of the specimen. The specimen is entirely submitted.\u000aMicro 1: medial margin, 5 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue from medial to lateral, 14 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 15: lateral margin, 4 frags, ESS.\u000ajmh\u000aReports to: IGLEHART, JAMES, DIRK M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
