he specimen are submitted for\u000ahistologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  fragments of specimen with microcalcifications from lateral to\u000amedial, 1 frag each, RSS\u000aMicro 4: inferior margin (inferior to micro #1), 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 5: medial, 1 frag, RSS\u000aMicro 6: lateral, 1 frag, RSS\u000afsd\u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
