0acentrally within the mass and is adajcent to the area of the clip. The breast\u000atissue as a whole is comprised of approximately 90% adipose tissue and 10%\u000afibrous tissue. The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted\u000afrom superior to inferior.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  left needle localized breast biopsy specimen, 4 frags, ESS\u000a(nodule adjacent to the medial margin is present primarily in\u000a#5 and 6 and the area of the clip is present in #8)\u000arp\u000aReports to: OSTEEN, ROBERT, T. M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
