u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", corresponding to a left breast excision with\u000ainked margin evaluation (7.6 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to\u000athe accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aTwelve (12) slides are labeled "SS-05-REMOVED_CASE_ID" and sublabeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", corresponding to a left breast re-excision with inked margin\u000aevaluation (8.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the\u000aaccompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Deborah A Dillon M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
