r\u000apathology protocol for the evaluation of margins: posterior/black;\u000aanterior/blue; superior/red; inferior/green; lateral/yellow; medial/orange.\u000aMicro 1: superior margins and adjacent medial margin, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  anterior, posterior, medial, lateral margins, 4 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro 6: inferior margin, 5 frags, ESS.\u000ajgi\u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
