eals a clip and a localization wire.\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  area of fibrosis, 12 frags, ESS\u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remaining breast parenchymal tissue, 18 frags, ESS\u000ajhl\u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS\u000a[report_end]
