en is serially\u000asectioned to reveal a tan nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm, abutting all\u000ainked margins. There is a biopsy cavity measuring REMOVED_DATE cm in greatest dimension\u000athat is submitted in micro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID. The specimen is entirely submitted for\u000ahistologic examination.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Medial, anterior, posterior and superior margin, 3 frags, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Biopsy cavity, anterior, posterior, superior, inferior margin, 1\u000afrag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Superior, inferior, anterior and posterior margin, 1 frag, ESS.\u000aMicro REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID: Superior, inferior and lateral margin, 2 frags, ESS.\u000aCASE NUMBER: REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID.\u000aech/ag\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Hejin P Hahn M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a1/25/2007\u000a[report_end]
