le is not present. The\u000abreast parenchyma consists of approximately 50% dense white tissue and the\u000aremainder, yellow/tan unremarkable adipose tissue. No gross lesions are\u000apresent.\u000aMicro #3-4: Breast parenchyma and skin, 6 frags, RSS.\u000aMicro #5-12: Additional sections of left breast, multi frags, RSS.\u000almb/\u000aReports to: PRIBAZ, JULIAN, JOSEPH M.D.\u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000a[report_end]
