 or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aResident Review by Deborah A Dillon M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000aSurgical Addendum: (8/1/05)\u000aSubsequently received on REMOVED_DATE  are three (3) additional slides, labeled\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and sublabeled "1 ER(+)", "2 2L" and "3 2L", which corresponds to\u000athe above case.\u000aThe atypical ductal hyperplasia is positive for estrogen receptor.\u000aTHE FINAL DIAGNOSIS IS UNCHANGED.\u000aAddendum by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aAddendum #1 by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end]
