ED_ACCESSION_ID\u000aER(+)", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID PR(+)", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID\u000aST", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ST" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ST", corresponding to A) right sentinel node #1 excision\u000a(3.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm, and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) B) right axillary excision (2.0 x\u000a1.5 x REMOVED_DATE cm) C) right breast excision (6.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on\u000a6/14/07, according to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's\u000aname. These slides are requested in order to compare the DCIS adjacent to the\u000ainvasive carcinoma to the DCIS in the subsequent excision.\u000aNinety-one (91) slides are labeled "07:REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and sublabeled "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "A REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "A REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID RC", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID",\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID RC", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID RC", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID RC", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID RC", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID",\u000a"REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ST II", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ST II", "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID"\u000athrough "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID" and "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK" through "REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID STK, corresponding to A) right breast,\u000alateral margin, re-excision (7.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) B) right breast, medial\u000amargin, re-excision (8.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) C) right breast, inferior margin,\u000are-excision (7.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the\u000aaccompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name.\u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she\u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated)\u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es)\u000arelated thereto.\u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on\u000a7/23/2007\u000a[report_end]
