D_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID/neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis. Added by: Atul Kumar Bhan, M.D. Signed On: 26 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 18:21 GROSS DESCRIPTION: Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name and unit number only, are multiple cores of fibrofatty tissue ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm which are submitted in toto as cassettes A-F. Gross Description by: TRANG HOANG Resident: MINDY J. HULL, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-OUTPATIENT (OFF.P/CLINIC) REPORTS TO: Kevin S. Hughes, M.D. Dianne Georgian-smith, M.D. James Neal Wise, M.D. PART : BREAST(LEFT),CORE BIOPSY
