ded by: Atul Kumar Bhan, M.D. Signed On: 05 REMOVED_MONTH 04 at 14:05 GROSS DESCRIPTION: Received in formalin, labeled with the patient's name and unit nubmer only are four cores of fibrofatty tissue ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm which are submitted in toto as cassette A. Gross Description by: LAURA NAKATSUKA Resident: DAVID COON, PhD, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-OUTPATIENT (OFF.P/CLINIC) REPORTS TO: Heather Aliotta, NP Dianne Georgian-smith, M.D. PART : BREAST(RIGHT 10:00),CORE BIOPSY
