PHEN LAU, MD *** INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS *** FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS: NO GROSS LESIONS SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA. O.R. Resident: HENRY DONG, MD O.R. Diagnosis by: Joseph Misdraji, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Kenneth Kenji Tanabe, M.D. PART A: BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION PART B: LYMPH NODES (LEFT AXILLA), EXCISION\u000a[report_end]
