. The surgical margins of resection are inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal an area of fibrosis which measures about 8 x 2 x 4 cm located beneath the lateral part of the skin. The closest distance to the fibrotic area from deep margin is REMOVED_DATE cm. The rest of parenchyma appears unremarkable except for areas of fibrosis. Sections through fibrotic area reveals also a focus of fat necrosis measuring REMOVED_DATE cm in greatest dimension. Representative sections submitted as follows: E: Deep margin F-S: Sections from the fibrotic area. T: Section from axillary tail area. U: Representative section from area far from the lesion. V: One section from nipple. Resident: BIZHAN BANDARCHI-CHAMKHALEH, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-INPATIENT (FLR.UNKNOWN) REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST (LEFT), SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B: BREAST (RIGHT), REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY\u000a[report_end]
