cm well circumscribed firm white-gray homogeneous lesion. This lesion comes to <0.1 cm from the closest inked surgical resection margin. The remaining breast parenchyma is predominantly fatty and grossly unremarkable. The specimen is submitted as follows: E-F: Lesion submitted entirely. G-H: Remaining breast tissue submitted entirely. Resident: JULIA TURBINER, M.D. =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT - REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT MEDIAL), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (RIGHT LATERAL), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY
