ments of reddish-yellow fibroadipose\u000atissue. The larger is 1 x 1 x REMOVED_DATE cm. and the smaller is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm.\u000aFocal nodularity is present. 2X all.\u000aDictated by: DJF____(signature on file)____DENNIS J. FEEN, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
