lar area\u000aof firmer tan tissue adjacent to a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm. focus of hemorrhage\u000aincluded in sections 7 and 8. Serially sectioned labeled REMOVED_DATE  24 agg.\u000aTotal fixation time 32 hours.\u000aDictated by: MJR____(signature on file)____ REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a____(signature on file)____MICHAEL J. ROSS, M.D. REMOVED_DATE  (Final)\u000a[report_end]
